    "full_page_text": "Result | Further Reading - Linkage Mechanism\n这节实现两个利用编码盘测量距离的功能，接下来修改程序，\n让测距机器人实现定点测量的功能。\n要求：通过控制器地址设定距离长度，在运行至指定距离时，\n蜂鸣器响起。\nWatt’s linkage\nWatt's linkage (also known as the\nparallel linkage) is a type of mechanical\nlinkage invented\nby James Watt who\nimproved the steam engine. In the Watt’s\nlinkage,\nthe\nfreedom\nof\nmovement’s\nmidpoint is limited, and it can only move\napproximately in a straight line. It was first\nused in the Watt steam turbine, and was\nlater used in the suspension structure of\nautomobiles.\n"
  },
