    "full_page_text": "Result | Further Reading - Linkage Mechanism\n这节实现两个利用编码盘测量距离的功能，接下来修改程序，\n让测距机器人实现定点测量的功能。\n要求：通过控制器地址设定距离长度，在运行至指定距离时，\n蜂鸣器响起。\nJansen's linkage\nJansen's linkage is a planar leg mechanism\ndesigned by the kinetic sculptor Theo Jansen to\ngenerate a smooth walking motion. Jansen has used his\nmechanism in a variety of kinetic sculptures which are\nknown as Strandbeesten (Dutch for \"beach beasts\").\nThis linkage has both aesthetic value and technical\nadvantages. It can imitate biological walking motion\nthrough simple rotation input. This linkage has been\nused in walking robots and gait analysis.\n"
  },
