    "full_page_text": "Result | Further Reading - Linkage Mechanism\n这节实现两个利用编码盘测量距离的功能，接下来修改程序，\n让测距机器人实现定点测量的功能。\n要求：通过控制器地址设定距离长度，在运行至指定距离时，\n蜂鸣器响起。\nPeaucellier–Lipkin linkage\nThe Peaucellier–Lipkin linkage,\ninvented in 1864, was the first true\nplanar straight line mechanism – the\nfirst\nplanar\nlinkage\ncapable\nof\ntransforming rotary motion into perfect\nstraight-line motion, and vice versa.\n"
